# Adapted from Fitz / fitzforge Polestar, GPL-3.0-only.
# Source: guides/forever/alliance/02-westfall.guide at 1775eb81e56fc1e127ae869ccec0b7dc8d7092fd.
# Aurum adaptation: Night Elf Druid, southern questing, dungeon interleaving.

step Back to Westfall
  tip After the Lordaeron rewards and any Stormwind turn-ins, return to Sentinel Hill. You should still have the final People's Militia quest and Moonbrook Espionage from your earlier Westfall visits. Completed quests check off automatically.
  fly "Sentinel Hill"
  level 16

step Optional: Furlbrow's pocket watch at 16 or later
  tip The Forgotten Heirloom is an optional northern detour, not part of the required leveling work. Farmer Furlbrow gives the quest at Jansen Stead. The wardrobe is in the ruined house east of Jangolode Mine, guarded by level-15 Benny Blaanco and nearby Defias. Playtesting found dense guards and rapid respawns here. Only attempt it at 16 or later if the camp is manageable; otherwise skip all three goals and continue. Return the watch to Farmer Furlbrow if you collect it.
  accept 64 optional
  collect 841 quest 64 optional
  turnin 64 optional

step Confirm the held follow-ups
  tip Gryan Stoutmantle gives the last militia assignment after the western-farm one; Alba gives Moonbrook Espionage after The State of the Mines. These are reminders for the already-accepted quests, not a second set of objectives.
  accept 14
  accept 92747

step Moonbrook and the Defias hills
  tip Defias Pathstalkers and Knuckledusters walk Moonbrook; Highwaymen (level 17) patrol the hills south and east of it in pairs: pull them apart. The Deadmines entrance in the smithy is a group dungeon.
  kill 121 quest 14
  kill 449 quest 14
  kill 122 quest 14
  collect 254676 quest 92747.1                -- Suspicious Industrial Supplies, from the crates around Moonbrook

step Moonbrook: Bewitchments and Glamours
  collect 209845 "Bewitchments and Glamours" @45.4,70.5 map 1436 era -- Pick up the book inside the eastern house before leaving Moonbrook. Keep it for the library. Skip this pickup if the house is unsafe.

step Back to Sentinel Hill
  tip Follow the road north-east from Moonbrook to Sentinel Hill. Do not wait for the hearthstone used after Lordaeron: this is a short walk. You may use it if already ready, but the guide navigates directly to the turn-in without requiring a cast.
  turnin 14                                   -- Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 65                                   -- For Wiley the Black in Lakeshire, Redridge
  turnin 92747                                -- Alba Fairmoon
  accept 92748                                optional -- For Sprite Jumpsprocket in Stormwind's Dwarven District
  vendor 8931 -- Sell, repair nearby and refill 10-20 affordable Melon Juice before the dungeon chain. Keep cloth, leather, your knife and book items.
  buy 1205 x20 npc 8931 optional

step Continue with the Lakeshire preparation loop
  note Keep Wiley's Defias report and Sprite's engineering letter. The next chapter combines the required Lakeshire visit with nearby outdoor quests before the level-18 dungeon check.
